# Package pool on the ISO medium (/pool, /dists), not installed in the image.
# Calamares' bootloader-config helper (flickos-installer) installs the
# bootloader for the firmware it finds from this pool, which sources-media
# adds as an apt source, so installing works offline.
#
# grub-pc and grub-efi-amd64 conflict, and live-build resolves each list as one
# apt transaction, so the UEFI packages are in grub-efi.list.binary.
grub-pc
